@title 3D Heat: fan opening in motion (run with KOPERCAD_MOTION=1)
@area 3D
# Fans turn and air dashes cross the openings in the live app; the harness (and Reduce motion) shows the still frame, so screenshots are deterministic.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text "Add opening"
wait 10
click_text "Filter fan, low on the door"
wait 20
shot fan-still-a
wait 30
shot fan-still-b
check_layout
